########

### Get guidance by id — exists
GET http://localhost:3000/api/first-aid-guidance/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer FLEET_MANAGER_TOKEN

########

### Get guidance by id — not found (should 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/first-aid-guidance/9999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer FLEET_MANAGER_TOKEN

########

